[{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_31100200_03_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_31100200_03_0010","text":"好嘞\n差不多该走了吧"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_31100200_03_0020","text":"哦哦，是啊"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_31100200_03_0030","text":"事务所里还有\n要做的事没做完……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_31100200_03_0040","text":"你也要\n好好回去啊"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_31100200_03_0041","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_31100200_03_0050","text":"喂，不能跟过来啦\n这边很危险的……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_31100200_03_0051","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_31100200_03_0060","text":"啊……这下麻烦了\n制作人，怎么办"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_31100200_03_0070","text":"哈哈"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_31100200_03_0080","text":"森林音乐队，成立了"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_31100200_03_0081","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_31100200_03_0090","text":"……！\n啊哈哈"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_31100200_03_0100","text":"──那这么说，跟我在一起的制作人\n也是音乐队的一员了"}]
